    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Conerney Estate Agents are delighted to present to market this fabulous own-door apartment for sale in Belarmine Vale in Stepaside. Belarmine is an extremely popular development, modernly built with an excellent B energy rating and in an excellent location. \r\nThe apartment itself is in excellent condition throughout, having been very well maintained by the owners and freshly painted throughout.\r\nThe large open plan living room lets in lots of natural light due to multiple windows and patio door, and the balcony offers lovely views for those summer evenings.\r\nThe open plan kitchen is a good size, modernly built with all mod cons.\r\nThere are two bedrooms, both fitted with built in wardrobes and the master is en-suite, tiled with shower.\r\nThe main bathroom is also fully tiled, fitted with bath and shower. Ample storage comes with this apartment with separate storage area.\r\nThe location of the property is second to none, being located close to primary and secondary schools and créches. There are also a number of supermarkets nearby including Dundrum town centre. The M50 motorway is just minutes away, the Luas green line only 5 minutes walk, and a wide variety of amenities are just around the corner.\r\nThis property really needs to be viewed to be appreciated, and offers a modern spacious property with excellent use of light and in an enviable location. For an immediate viewing, please apply online, leave your name, number and email address and we will get right back to you. If you have any questions or wish to discuss the property further, please call us on 01-4926004."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A Fantastic Property in a Great location\r\n\r\nB Energy Rating - Energy Efficient Property & Green Mortgage Rates\r\n\r\nGas Fired Central Heating & Double Glazed Windows\r\n\r\nClose to Host of Amenities - LUAS, M50, Carrickmines, Dundrum\r\n\r\nAbundance of Natural Light\r\n\r\nOwn-Door Duplex Apartment"
      },
      {
